      "skill_list": {
        "0": {
          "$deleted": false,
          "class": "Mutant",
          "description": "<p><img style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" src=\"https://assets.forge-vtt.com/610d918102e7ac281373ffcb/Skill%20Icon/FFXIVIcons%20Battle(PvE)/RPR/unveiled_gibbet.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\"></p>\n<hr>\n<p>You may use an action and spend one third of your current Hit Points (rounded down)<br>to manifest your <strong>Wolf Claw </strong>and gain the following effects<strong>:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Your attacks with <strong>unarmed strikes</strong> gain <strong><strong>multi (3)</strong></strong><hr></li>\n</ul>\n<p><em>This effect last until the end of this scene, You may end this effect at any time, but during a conflict</em><br><em>you can only do so on your turn, before or after an action. At the end of a conflict, if you are under this effect, you may</em><br><em>spend 10 Mind Points to extendthe effect to the next scene you will be a part of.</em></p>",
          "level": "1",
          "roll": "",
          "skill_name": "Wolfs Claw"
        },
        "1": {
          "$deleted": false,
          "class": "Mutant",
          "description": "<p><img style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" src=\"https://assets.forge-vtt.com/610d918102e7ac281373ffcb/Skill%20Icon/FFXIVIcons%20Battle(PvE)/14_SMN/summon_phoenix.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\"></p>\n<hr>\n<p>You may use an action and spend one third of your current Hit Points (rounded down)<br>to manifest your <strong>Griffon Wing </strong>and gain the following effects<strong>:</strong>&nbsp;</p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"text-align: center;\">your melee attacks can target flying creatures<hr></li>\n</ul>\n<p><em>This effect last until the end of this scene, You may end this effect at any time, but during a conflict</em><br><em>you can only do so on your turn, before or after an action. At the end of a conflict, if you are under this effect, you may</em><br><em>spend 10 Mind Points to extendthe effect to the next scene you will be a part of.</em></p>",
          "level": "1",
          "roll": "",
          "skill_name": "Griffons Wing"
        },
        "2": {
          "$deleted": false,
          "class": "Mutant",
          "description": "<p><img style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" src=\"https://assets.forge-vtt.com/610d918102e7ac281373ffcb/Skill%20Icon/FFXIVIcons%20Battle(PvE)/BLU/exuviation.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\"></p>\n<hr>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">You treat your <strong>Insight</strong> as if it were <strong>one die size higher</strong> (to a maximum of d12).<br>When you deal damage to one or more creatures for the first time during your turn, if<br>at least one of them is in Crisis, you deal <strong>5 extra damage</strong> to each of those creatures</p>",
          "level": "1",
          "roll": "",
          "skill_name": "Hawks Eye"
        },
        "3": {
          "$deleted": false,
          "class": "Mutant",
          "description": "<p><img style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" src=\"https://assets.forge-vtt.com/610d918102e7ac281373ffcb/Skill%20Icon/FFXIVIcons%20Battle(PvE)/BLU/flying_sardine.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\"></p>\n<hr>\n<p>You may use an action and spend one third of your current Hit Points (rounded down)<br>to manifest your <strong>Squalus Fang </strong>and gain the following effects<strong>:</strong>&nbsp;</p>\n<ul>\n<li>You may breathe underwater</li>\n<li>You can see perfectly in dim light.</li>\n<li>When you recover Hit Points, you recover 5 additional Hit Points and you may immediately recover from a single status effect of your choice.</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
          "level": "1",
          "roll": "",
          "skill_name": "Squalus Fang"
        },
        "4": {
          "$deleted": false,
          "class": "Mutant",
          "description": "<p><img style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" src=\"https://assets.forge-vtt.com/610d918102e7ac281373ffcb/Skill%20Icon/FFXIVIcons%20Battle(PvE)/BLU/the_dragon%27s_voice.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\"></p>\n<hr>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">When you deal damage with an attack or spell, you may have all that damage become <strong>bolt</strong>. While your unarmed strikes deal bolt damage, any enemy who <strong>loses 20 or more Hit Points</strong> due to one of your unarmed strikes also suffers <strong>slow</strong>.</p>",
          "level": "1",
          "roll": "",
          "skill_name": "Taurus Horn"
        },
        "5": {
          "$deleted": false,
          "class": "Mutant",
          "description": "<p><img src=\"https://assets.forge-vtt.com/610d918102e7ac281373ffcb/Skill%20Icon/FFXIVIcons%20Battle(PvE)/BLU/the_look.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\"></p>\n<hr>\n<p>Your unarmed strikes deal <strong>【6 + (SL &times; 2)</strong>】 extra damage, and you gain a bonus equal to <strong>【SL】</strong> to your Accuracy Checks with them.</p>",
          "level": "3",
          "roll": "",
          "skill_name": "Feral Instinct"
        },
        "6": {
          "$deleted": false,
          "class": "Mutant",
          "description": "<p><img style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" src=\"https://assets.forge-vtt.com/610d918102e7ac281373ffcb/Skill%20Icon/FFXIVIcons%20Battle(PvE)/BLU/peculiar_light.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\"></p>\n<hr>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">After one of your attacks or offensive spells (r) causes one or more enemies to lose.<br>Hit Points, if you are in <strong>Crisis</strong>, you may recover <strong>【SL &times; 5】</strong> Hit Points.</p>",
          "level": "2",
          "roll": "",
          "skill_name": "Predation"
        },
        "7": {
          "$deleted": true,
          "class": "Mutant",
          "description": "<p><img style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" src=\"https://assets.forge-vtt.com/610d918102e7ac281373ffcb/Skill%20Icon/FFXIVIcons%20Battle(PvE)/BLU/gobskin.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\"></p>\n<hr>\n<p>After you lose Hit Points due to damage, if that damage had a type other than physical,<br>you may spend <strong>10 Hit Points</strong> to gain Resistance to that damage type until you use this<br>Skill again. You cannot use this Skill if doing so would reduce you to <strong>0 HP</strong>.</p>",
          "level": "1",
          "roll": "",
          "skill_name": "Chimera Shift"
        },
        "8": {
          "$deleted": false,
          "class": "Fury",
          "description": "<p><img style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" src=\"https://assets.forge-vtt.com/610d918102e7ac281373ffcb/Skill%20Icon/FFXIVIcons%20Battle(PvE)/02_WAR/holmgang.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\"></p>\n<hr>\n<p>As long as you are in Crisis, you deal <strong>【SL &times; 2】</strong> extra damage</p>",
          "level": "5",
          "roll": "",
          "skill_name": "Adrenaline"
        },
